WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — jouleos (ha) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:09.560
<v Narrator>A farko, kwamfutocin yau suna da yawa daban-daban sassa, kuma masu aiki na AI ana sanya su a sama ba tare da canzawa ba.

2
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:18.445
<v Narrator>Na biyu, babu ɗayan waɗannan layuka da ke tambaya a gaba game da yawan makamashi wanda aikin mai aiki zai kashe.

3
00:00:18.525 --> 00:00:29.790
<v Narrator>Na uku, injin mai aiki da hannu ya kamata ya auna makamashi, ya sanya dokoki masu tsauri na kasafin kudi, kuma ya ki yin ayyuka da ke karya su.
